        +'<div class="sec-head"><span class="live-dot"></span><h2 style="font-size:19px">Latest activity</h2><span class="demo-chip">Simulated demo activity</span><div class="right"><div class="tabs" id="bgTabs"><button data-bg-tab="mine">My Bets</button><button class="on" data-bg-tab="all">All Activity</button><button data-bg-tab="high">Big Demo Bets</button><button data-bg-tab="race">Race Leaderboard</button></div></div></div>'
        +'<div class="table-wrap feed-wrap"><table><thead id="bgTableHead"><tr><th>Game</th><th>Player</th><th class="col-time">Time</th><th>Demo bet</th><th class="col-mult">Multiplier</th><th>Status</th><th style="text-align:right">Profit (demo)</th></tr></thead><tbody id="bgBetsBody">'+bgInitialBetsHtml()+'</tbody></table></div>'
        +secHead("About Betvora burst games")
        +'<div class="card"><div class="gs-article">'
        +'<div><h3>Burst games at Betvora — speciality games, exclusively fast</h3><p>The online casino world is filled to the brim with fantastic ways to play — and burst games are the newest of them. This is a category of speciality games that blends the worlds of online gambling and video games: vibrant colours, big payouts and wacky animations, in rounds that never last more than a few seconds.</p>'
        +'<h3>What are burst games?</h3><p>These are the games that do not necessarily fit the mould. Instead of paylines, reels or standard ways of betting, every round is unique and fun, with special mechanics such as crash curves, pickaxe drops and balloon-popping jackpots. Most are built by specialist burst studios, and the Betvora Studios titles run on the same provably-fair engine as our originals.</p>'
        +'<h3>How to play burst games</h3><p>The best part is that each one is different — from flying planes to dropping eggs, there is a wide range of game features, popular themes and interesting mechanics to explore. Pick a title, set your bet, and learn its one rule: in crash games you cash out before the burst; in drops you watch where things land; in mines you decide how greedy to get.</p></div>'
        +'<div><h3>The burst families</h3>'+tableHtml(["Family","How it plays"],[["Crash & fly","A multiplier climbs until it bursts — cash out first"],["Plinko & drops","Balls and pucks fall through pegs into multiplier slots"],["Mines & grids","Pick safe tiles, dodge the hidden bombs"],["Keno & numbers","Pick numbers, match the draw, climb the paytable"],["Dice & towers","Set your target, or climb floors for growing multipliers"]],false)
        +'<h3>Strategies &amp; tips to win</h3><ul><li><b>Set a budget</b> — never spend more than you can afford to lose, especially while learning new mechanics.</li><li><b>Pay attention to the stats</b> — RTP, house edge and volatility are printed on every title; pick the mix that suits your style.</li><li><b>Start small</b> — if you are new to speciality games, keep wagers small until the mechanic feels familiar.</li><li><b>Use auto cash-out</b> — in crash games, a preset exit beats a greedy finger almost every time.</li></ul></div>'
        +'</div>'
        +'<div class="gs-article" id="bgMore">'
        +'<div><h3>Payouts, house edge &amp; RTP on burst games</h3><p>Each burst game has its own features and specifications, and its RTP is printed on the tile before you play. Most of the catalogue sits between 95% and 99% — the Betvora Studios titles run at 97% and up, with Dice Xtreme-style target games at the sharp end. Understanding the house edge on your chosen title is the smartest first bet you can make.</p>'
        +'<h3>Fairness — RNG and provably-fair bursts</h3><p>Third-party burst games decide their rounds with certified random number generators (RNG), audited before a title is allowed onto this page. Betvora Studios bursts go further: every round is decided by the same seed-pair system as Dice and Crash, so you can verify the burst point yourself after the round ends.</p></div>'
        +'<div><h3>Bonuses &amp; the VIP program</h3><p>Every burst bet earns VIP rakeback and counts toward the $100,000 Weekly Race and the $75,000 Raffle, exactly like the originals. Whether you are riding a crash curve or exploring the full catalogue, there is always a promotion running alongside.</p>'+secBtn("promos","See Promotions")
        +'<h3>Play responsibly</h3><p>Burst games are fast — rounds end in seconds and it is easy to lose track. Set deposit and loss limits, take breaks, and remember the demo balances here are play money. If the fun stops, support can help you set limits or take a cooling-off period.</p><button class="btn btn-ghost" data-support style="height:38px;font-size:13.5px">Talk to support</button></div>'
        +'</div>'
        +'<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:18px"><button class="btn btn-ghost" id="bgMoreBtn">Show more</button></div></div>'
        +relHtml([["section:games","Casino Games"],["section:gameshows","Game Shows"],["section:livecasino","Live Casino"],["promos","Promos & Competitions"]]);
